    "field": "organelle",
    "value": "rough ER: 3 abundant",
    "quote": "These cells differ in morphology from standard B and T cells in that they contain a large amount of cytoplasm packed with the protein-synthesizing machinery known as rough endoplasmic reticulum.",
    "source": {
     "section": "21.1 Anatomy of the Lymphatic and Immune Systems",
